ling Test conducted on10-12-2025, 11-12-2025 & 12-12-2025.\nAdvertisement No. PHC/01/2025\nList of Candidates Qualified at the Cycling Test conducted on10-12-2025, 11-12-2025 & 12-12-2025.\nAdvertisement No. PHC/01/2025\nList of Candidates Qualified at the Cycling Test conducted on10-12-2025, 11-12-2025 & 12-12-2025.\nAdvertisement No. PHC/01/2025\nList of Candidates Qualified at the Cycling Test conducted on10-12-2025, 11-12-2025 & 12-12-2025.\nAdvertisement No. PHC/01/2025\nList of Candidates Qualified at the Cycling Test conducted on10-12-2025, 11-12-2025 & 12-12-2025.\nAdvertisement No. PHC/01/2025\nList of Candidates Qualified at the Cycling Test conducted on10-12-2025, 11-12-2025 & 12-12-2025.\nAdvertisement No. PHC/01/2025\nList of Candidates Not Qualified at the Cycling Test conducted on10-12-2025, 11-12-2025 & 12-12-2025.\nAdvertisement No. PHC/01/2025\n1 108476 205978 KHUSHBOO KUMARI 25-01-1990 Female BC Exempted\n2 110595 251812 PUNAM KUMARI 05-02-1995 Female SC Exempted\n3 115247 200434 JUHI KUMARI 02-01-1995 Female BC Exempted\n4 117587 210929 SHWETA KUMARI 15-02-1999 Female BC Exempted\n5 124250 226897 JYOTI RAJ 05-02-2000 Female BC Exempted\n6 125257 250718 NADRA PERWEEN 08-10-2003 Female EBC Exempted\n7 125418 230605 RENU KUMARI 08-08-1992 Female BC Exempted\n8 133121 264814 VARSHA RANI 03-01-1998 Female EBC ExemptedAnnexure-IV\n\nFULL TEXT:\nREGULAR MAZDOOR RECRUITMENT EXAMINATION, 2025\nNOTICE\nNo.- 100/R&A Dated: 18th December, 2025\nThe Cycling Test under the Regular Mazdoor Recruitment Examination, 2025\n(Advertisement No. PHC/01/2025) was conducted on 10th, 11th and 12th December, 2025 at\nMiller High School Ground in Patna. A total of 4577 candidates, excluding 180 candidates\nbelonging to the OH category from amongst 4,757 candidates who had been shortlisted after the\nWritten Test, were invited for the Cycling Test.\nAltogether, 3,366 candidates appeared and 1,203 remained absent in the Cycling Test.\nOut of these 3,366 candidates who appeared for the Cycling Test, a total of 3,310 candidates\nqualified at the test, their list (Roll Numbers only) is enclosed as Annexure-I. The remaining 56\ncandidates did not qualify the Cycling Test, and their list (Roll Numbers only) is enclosed as\nAnnexure-II.\nAnnexure-III contains the list (Roll Numbers only) of 180 candidates belonging to the OH\ncategory, who had already been exempted from undergoing the Cycling Test as per the published\nadvertisement.\nFurther, eight (08) candidates were granted exemption from appearing in the Cycling Test,\nat this stage, on the basis of medical conditions submitted by them, with the condition that, if\nselected in the final result, their selection shall remain subject to passing the Cycling Test to be\nconducted at a later stage. Details of such candidates are enclosed as Annexure-IV.\nThe candidates whose Roll Number appear in the list enclosed as Annexure-I, Annexure-\nIII & Annexure-IV have been shortlisted for appearing in the next stage, i.e., the Skill Test &\nInterview. Altogether, the shortlisted candidate count is 3498.\nCandidature of the shortlisted candidates is provisional subject to their being found\neligible in all respect in terms of advertisement.\nAll the shortlisted candidates will have to first undergo the Skill Test scheduled to\nbe held from 23rd to 29th December, 2025 in Patna or Hajipur. Details of the Skill Test with\nvenue of the test will be given in their Admit Card which will be made available in due\ncourse and may be downloaded from the official website of the High Court, i.e.,\nhttps://patnahighcourt.gov.in/notices/recruitments. Admit Cards will not separately be\nsent to candidates through any other mode.\nThe candidates are advised to keep visiting the Court’s official website regularly for\nfurther details/updates.\nBy order of the Court\nSd/- Anamika T.\nRegistrar General I/c\nAdvertisement No. PHC/01/2025\nList of Candidates Qualified at the Cycling Test conducted on10-12-2025, 11-12-20